LegalBench — licence and attribution
====================================

This directory redistributes data derived from LegalBench.

SPDX-License-Identifier: CC-BY-4.0
Licence:                 CC BY 4.0
Full licence text:       https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode
Upstream dataset:        https://huggingface.co/datasets/nguha/legalbench

Citation
--------
Guha, N. et al. LegalBench: A Collaboratively Built Benchmark for Measuring
Legal Reasoning in Large Language Models. Adv. Neural Inf. Process. Syst. 36
(2023).

